-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This site is built on the Dinky theme for GitHub Pages:

  https://github.com/pages-themes/dinky

Dinky is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, which asks for
no attribution. It is credited here anyway, because the site is a genuine
derivative rather than a mere consumer of the theme: _layouts/default.html
began as a copy of Dinky's own layout, and assets/css/style.scss imports
Dinky's stylesheet and restates a number of its rules on top of it.

Two typefaces, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, handled differently:

  Inter, by Rasmus Andersson -- body copy. A subset of it IS redistributed by
  this repository, as assets/fonts/inter-latin-var.woff2. The OFL requires that
  the licence travel with the font, so its text sits beside the file as
  assets/fonts/Inter-OFL.txt, carrying the Inter Project Authors' copyright.
  The subset is a derivative of the upstream variable font: the weight axis is
  clamped to 400-700, the optical-size axis is pinned, and the character set is
  cut to latin plus Latin Extended-A. assets/css/style.scss records the exact
  commands, so the derivation is reproducible.

  Arvo, by Anton Koovit -- headings. Requested from Google Fonts by Dinky's own
  stylesheet, not redistributed here, so no licence file is required for it.
